      <section id="directory" class="section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading split">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow accent">Regional agency directory</p>
              <h2>Trusted representation across South Africa.</h2>
            </div>
            <a class="text-link" href="#contact">Submit your profile</a>
          </div>

          <div class="directory-grid">
            <article class="location-card">
              <div class="city-tag">Johannesburg</div>
              <h3>Urban Vogue Talent</h3>
              <p>Fashion, commercial, and runway model recruitment for emerging and established talent.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Runway & editorial</li>
                <li>Commercial bookings</li>
                <li>Portfolio review support</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="#contact">Request info</a>
            </article>

            <article class="location-card">
              <div class="city-tag alt">Cape Town</div>
              <h3>Atlantic Lens Models</h3>
              <p>Beauty, lifestyle, luxury, and campaign representation for standout talent.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Beauty campaigns</li>
                <li>Editorial work</li>
                <li>Brand casting</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="#contact">Request info</a>
            </article>

            <article class="location-card">
              <div class="city-tag alt-two">Durban</div>
              <h3>Coastal Edge Agency</h3>
              <p>Support for models in KwaZulu-Natal and surrounding regions seeking growth opportunities.</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Promotional work</li>
                <li>Commercial castings</li>
                <li>New-face development</li>
              </ul>
              <a href="#contact">Request info</a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="portfolio" class="section section-muted">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow accent">Digital portfolio guide</p>
            <h2>How to submit your portfolio like a professional.</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="steps-grid">
            <div class="step-card">
              <span class="step-number">01</span>
              <h3>Build a clean portfolio</h3>
              <p>Use your strongest headshots, full-body images, and a few lifestyle or commercial shots.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step-card">
              <span class="step-number">02</span>
              <h3>Create a digital package</h3>
              <p>Use a PDF, online gallery, or single-page portfolio with crisp images and consistent styling.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step-card">
              <span class="step-number">03</span>
              <h3>Write a strong profile</h3>
              <p>Include height, measurements, location, availability, and a short introduction tailored to your market.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step-card">
              <span class="step-number">04</span>
              <h3>Submit professionally</h3>
              <p>Follow agency instructions, be concise, and respond promptly with a polished, respectful message.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="safety" class="section">
        <div class="container safety-layout">
          <div>
            <div class="section-heading left">
              <p class="eyebrow accent">Scam prevention</p>
              <h2>Protect your image, time, and investment.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="checklist">
              <label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" checked /> Verify agency credentials and business details before sending portfolio materials.</label>
              <label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" checked /> Never pay upfront booking or registration fees without a written agreement.</label>
              <label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" checked /> Ask for a proper casting brief, client information, and contract terms in writing.</label>
              <label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" checked /> Be cautious of “instant success” promises or rushed decisions that pressure you to act.</label>
              <label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" checked /> Use secure communication channels and avoid sharing sensitive documents with unverified contacts.</label>
              <label class="check-item"><input type="checkbox" checked /> If something feels vague or rushed, pause and verify independently.</label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="safety-card">
            <h3>Quick safety checklist</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Confirm identity and registration</li>
              <li>Request written terms</li>
              <li>Research the agency or client</li>
              <li>Review all contracts carefully</li>
              <li>Never share bank details too early</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Report suspicious outreach</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="resources" class="section section-muted">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow accent">Industry resource hub</p>
            <h2>Helpful tools and guidance to support your career.</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="resource-grid">
            <article class="resource-card">
              <h3>Portfolio essentials</h3>
              <p>Checklist for headshots, body shots, styling consistency, and industry-ready presentation.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="resource-card">
              <h3>Booking basics</h3>
              <p>Track payments, invoices, contracts, and essential communication like a professional.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="resource-card">
              <h3>Networking</h3>
              <p>Build a reputation through castings, collaborations, fashion communities, and social visibility.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="resource-card">
              <h3>Ethical casting</h3>
              <p>Understand the standards responsible agencies and clients should meet before confirming a booking.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
